METADATA:{"created":"2026/05/10 20:10:32","modified":"2026/05/10 18:16:16","chunkId":"Demo&&Resources/Minecraft/resourcepacks/FOR MODS/patpat/PatPat-资源包制作指南.md#13","heading":"Python 打包脚本"}

NOTE BLOCK CONTENT:

#### Python 打包脚本

```python
import zipfile, os

src_dir = "my_pack_folder"  # 源文件夹
with zipfile.ZipFile("my_pack.zip", "w", zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED) as zf:
    for root, dirs, files in os.walk(src_dir):
        for f in files:
            fp = os.path.join(root, f)
            arcname = os.path.relpath(fp, src_dir)
            zf.write(fp, arcname)
```

