METADATA:{"created":"2026/05/10 20:10:32","modified":"2026/05/10 18:16:16","chunkId":"Demo&&Resources/Minecraft/resourcepacks/FOR MODS/patpat/PatPat-资源包制作指南.md#18","heading":"`animation` 对象"}

NOTE BLOCK CONTENT:

#### `animation` 对象

| 字段           | 类型      | 默认值 | 说明                                                       |
| ------------ | ------- | --- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| `texture` ✅  | String  | —   | 纹理路径，如 `"patpat:textures/xxx.png"`。纹理必须在 `textures/` 目录下 |
| `duration` ✅ | Integer | —   | 动画持续时间（毫秒），不可为负                                          |
| `frame` ✅    | Object  | —   | 帧设置                                                      |
| `sound` ✅    | Object  | 无   | 音效设置                                                     |



